  id: iron_sentinel
  displayName: Iron Sentinel
  description: Guards a Kin smithy in the Badlands. Fully armored, near-invincible
    from the front.
  tier: 1
  family: 1
  behaviors:
  - "Cannot be damaged from the front \u2014 must hit from behind or sides."
  - Slow turning, predictable.
  - "Has a 'rage' phase when its armor cracks at 33% HP \u2014 much faster and more
    aggressive."
  - Stomps create shockwaves that knock back.
  abilities:
  - "Greatsword Cleave \u2014 wide frontal arc"
  - "Shoulder Bash \u2014 forward charge"
  - "Earth Tremor \u2014 radial stomp"
  - "Rage Phase \u2014 strips armor, faster movement, exposed weak points"
  dropItemIds:
  - Sentinel Plating (masterwork armor mat)
  - Iron Ingot x8, Titanium Plate x2
  - Sealed Helm (display trophy)
  - Spirit Anchor
  boss_section: Warden Family
  isBoss: 1
  isFinale: 0
  baseHealth: 30
  baseSpeed: 4
